## Scripts & Runtime Scaffold

The `scripts/` directory provides production-tested scaffolding:

- `scripts/pipeline_template/`: Blueprint for an isolated pipeline package (registry, input builder, defensive parser, policy code, config, and unit tests).
- `scripts/runtime/`: Reusable runtime components (client protocol, `FakeDecisionsClient`, resilience, circuit breaker, decision records, and refusal policies).
- `scripts/snippets/`: Unit-tested implementations of all algorithms and course snippets.
- `scripts/experiments/`: Standalone runnable scripts for all empirical experiments.
- `scripts/verify_volatile_facts.py`: Live verification script for checking model behavior, token limits, and pricing.
- `scripts/tests/`: Comprehensive test suite verifying all code offline by default.
